      "created_at": "2017-10-09T15:05:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Just been thinking about how characters from Sentinels of the Multiverse don't always tend to be 'alive' in the way we understand it. I was thinking of gathering a list, as my own reference/amusement.</p><p><span>Ones I can think of, off the top of my head:</span></p><ul>\n<li><span>Dark Watch era Mr Fixer, a ghost haunting his own corpse</span></li>\n<li><span>Fanatic... I can't put that into a simple sentence.</span></li>\n<li><span>Absolute Zero, who doesn't eat, breathe or sleep</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Any others we know of?&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:17.060Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 10,
