      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>&quot;Aliveness&quot; in the Sentinels verse seems to revolve around the twin ideas of sapience (re: stuff like how discussion of what beings could become a Virtuoso seems to revolve around sapience and what counts as being sapient) and some sort of nebulous idea of the &quot;soul&quot; (re: stuff like the weird Void afterlife thing, Fixer&#39;s situation, how Idealist wasn&#39;t seen as being truly alive until she got that life energy spark, etc.)</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Though granted this still raises about as many questions as it answers.</span></p>",
